282
00:20:25,780 --> 00:20:27,660
Well, I think...

283
00:20:28,260 --> 00:20:30,260
sitting somewhere quiet
and watching the water

284
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:36,420
might help take your mind off things.

285
00:20:41,620 --> 00:20:43,580
If there's anything
you wanna get off your chest,

286
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:46,280
just let it out.

287
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:49,340
Just think of me...

288
00:20:49,700 --> 00:20:51,220
as a toilet.

289
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:54,820
So old-fashioned.

290
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,180
What even was that?

291
00:21:01,340 --> 00:21:02,900
That woman...

292
00:21:05,580 --> 00:21:06,940
Linlin, right?

293
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:14,590
She's my half-sister.

294
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:26,500
I'm not sure
I can really call her that, though.

295
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:33,110
She might not
even see me as her little sister.

296
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:37,860
Just like how Dad...

297
00:21:39,260 --> 00:21:41,780
didn't see Mom and me
as part of the family.

298
00:21:48,220 --> 00:21:51,390
The only thing I got from that family

299
00:21:53,260 --> 00:21:55,060
was probably their last name.

300
00:21:57,220 --> 00:21:59,300
That family has it all.

301
00:22:01,190 --> 00:22:02,310
Fame,

302
00:22:03,740 --> 00:22:05,200
fortune,

303
00:22:06,290 --> 00:22:07,770
and respect.

304
00:22:10,110 --> 00:22:11,790
As for me...

305
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:16,480
I'm just the child of his other family,

306
00:22:19,300 --> 00:22:22,260
living off the money he sends me.

307
00:22:26,140 --> 00:22:28,140
No pride in me.

308
00:22:30,060 --> 00:22:31,840
Not even a word to say they miss me.

309
00:22:37,340 --> 00:22:38,580
That's why...

310
00:22:40,800 --> 00:22:43,400
I don't want anything from them.

311
00:22:46,420 --> 00:22:49,020
I don't want to ask them for any help.

312
00:22:52,060 --> 00:22:53,540
But today,

313
00:22:56,740 --> 00:22:58,900
seeing Linlin standing there,

314
00:23:01,900 --> 00:23:03,380
so beautiful

315
00:23:05,340 --> 00:23:06,540
and radiant,

316
00:23:10,110 --> 00:23:12,030
surrounded by people...

317
00:23:19,060 --> 00:23:21,220
sometimes I wonder...

318
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:28,360
if things would have been different

319
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:34,740
had I been born into a better family.

320
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:43,540
It's funny, though.

321
00:23:46,980 --> 00:23:49,900
Deep down, I still want him to notice me.

322
00:23:52,820 --> 00:23:54,820
I still want him to love me,

323
00:23:57,180 --> 00:23:59,180
even though I keep saying I don't care.

324
00:24:02,140 --> 00:24:03,700
But Auntie Phing

325
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:06,500
loves you,

326
00:24:07,020 --> 00:24:08,000
doesn't she?

327
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:17,320
Yes.

328
00:24:20,380 --> 00:24:21,600
My mom

329
00:24:22,860 --> 00:24:24,540
means everything to me.

330
00:24:27,300 --> 00:24:29,300
That's why I've been working hard

331
00:24:30,060 --> 00:24:32,020
and saving up for both of us.

332
00:24:35,740 --> 00:24:37,220
I think...

333
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:40,020
if there's anyone

334
00:24:40,620 --> 00:24:42,500
who should be proud of you,

335
00:24:43,940 --> 00:24:45,340
you should be

336
00:24:46,060 --> 00:24:47,700
one of them, you know?

337
00:24:51,020 --> 00:24:53,140
And I'm sure Auntie Phing

338
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:55,380
is very proud

339
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:58,340
to have a daughter as lovely as you.

340
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:09,180
You've done so well.

341
00:25:24,800 --> 00:25:27,740
Jeez, Xinxin, fried food again?

342
00:25:29,100 --> 00:25:31,580
It's not like I eat fried food every day.

343
00:25:31,820 --> 00:25:34,700
But you do eat unhealthy food every day.

344
00:25:36,980 --> 00:25:37,620
Fair enough.

345
00:25:42,460 --> 00:25:44,510
How about we talk about you?

346
00:25:45,740 --> 00:25:47,220
What do you wanna know?

347
00:25:49,260 --> 00:25:50,340
Well, your nickname.

348
00:25:50,660 --> 00:25:52,260
Why Soul?

349
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:54,340
Was Auntie Tai pregnant
when she was in Korea?

350
00:25:54,620 --> 00:25:56,780
No, not the same thing.

351
00:25:57,220 --> 00:25:58,380
My nickname, Soul,

352
00:25:58,780 --> 00:26:00,300
means spirit.

353
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:02,560
My dad named me that

354
00:26:02,580 --> 00:26:04,800
because he wanted me to grow up

355
00:26:04,820 --> 00:26:08,500
to be steady, grounded,

356
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:10,600
and confident in myself.

357
00:26:12,500 --> 00:26:14,540
What about your name?

358
00:26:15,120 --> 00:26:16,580
Tantiya?

359
00:26:17,660 --> 00:26:18,980
It means...

360
00:26:19,180 --> 00:26:20,780
structured knowledge.

361
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:25,500
That really does describe you.

362
00:26:26,420 --> 00:26:28,860
I think your dad must be so proud of you.

363
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:32,480
Oh.

364
00:26:32,860 --> 00:26:33,980
What about you?

365
00:26:35,220 --> 00:26:36,460
What does yours mean?

366
00:26:36,980 --> 00:26:38,340
Xinxin

367
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:40,340
comes from Chinese.

368
00:26:40,600 --> 00:26:42,180
It means confidence.

369
00:26:42,740 --> 00:26:44,620
As for Renita,

370
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,160
it means elegance.

371
00:26:46,180 --> 00:26:47,260
Wow.

372
00:26:47,610 --> 00:26:49,850
That suits you so well.

373
00:27:31,780 --> 00:27:33,220
Until now,

374
00:27:34,340 --> 00:27:36,660
you might have thought that
Auntie Phing was all you had.

375
00:27:37,560 --> 00:27:39,340
So you felt like you had to be strong,

376
00:27:40,220 --> 00:27:41,980
take care of everything,

377
00:27:42,300 --> 00:27:44,620
and solve every problem alone.

378
00:27:46,260 --> 00:27:47,700
But from now on,

379
00:27:48,460 --> 00:27:49,980
don't think that way anymore, alright?

380
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:53,820
But...

381
00:27:54,660 --> 00:27:56,660
Mom is the only person I have.

382
00:27:58,940 --> 00:28:00,300
From now on,

383
00:28:00,840 --> 00:28:02,780
can I be one of those people, too?

384
00:28:04,760 --> 00:28:06,180
I'll be the one to

385
00:28:06,820 --> 00:28:08,580
take care of you and look after you.

386
00:28:30,500 --> 00:28:32,860
Are you staying up until I fall asleep?

387
00:28:33,900 --> 00:28:36,640
I just wanna see why you're this stubborn.

388
00:28:36,660 --> 00:28:38,900
You've got a home of your own.
Why don't you go back?

389
00:28:43,180 --> 00:28:45,620
Well, I said I'd take care of you.

390
00:28:46,420 --> 00:28:48,820
How can I leave you all alone?

391
00:28:49,980 --> 00:28:51,660
But I haven't given you an answer yet.

392
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:54,980
No answer?

393
00:28:56,220 --> 00:28:57,700
That's totally fine.

394
00:28:58,180 --> 00:29:00,100
Both the taking-care-of-you part

395
00:29:01,220 --> 00:29:02,700
and the liking-you part.

396
00:29:03,520 --> 00:29:04,700
Don't say that.

397
00:29:04,980 --> 00:29:06,260
I'll get you if you do.

398
00:29:08,220 --> 00:29:09,660
So threatening.

399
00:29:09,940 --> 00:29:11,220
It's not a threat.

400
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:13,020
Or do you wanna test me?

401
00:29:13,540 --> 00:29:15,740
Fine, I won't say it.

402
00:29:18,980 --> 00:29:19,980
But I'll wait.

403
00:29:23,040 --> 00:29:25,100
Then wait ten years.

404
00:29:28,800 --> 00:29:29,900
I can wait

405
00:29:30,500 --> 00:29:32,140
if you want me to.

406
00:29:44,690 --> 00:29:45,750
Xinxin.

407
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:51,020
Sweet dreams.

408
00:29:55,690 --> 00:29:56,950
You too, Soul.

409
00:30:20,880 --> 00:30:22,780
I'm so damn blushing!

410
00:30:49,020 --> 00:30:50,620
She already left?

411
00:30:55,860 --> 00:30:57,440
I went home already.

412
00:30:57,460 --> 00:30:59,640
Auntie Phing might be surprised
if she comes back and sees me.

413
00:30:59,660 --> 00:31:01,840
Your breakfast is in the kitchen.

414
00:31:01,860 --> 00:31:02,580
From Soul.

415
00:31:05,660 --> 00:31:06,960
Xinxin, dear.

416
00:31:06,980 --> 00:31:07,800
Mom!

417
00:31:07,820 --> 00:31:10,180
There you are.

418
00:31:12,500 --> 00:31:14,780
I miss you so much.

419
00:31:14,800 --> 00:31:15,540
Come here.

420
00:31:16,620 --> 00:31:17,920
Oh, wait, wait, wait.

421
00:31:17,940 --> 00:31:19,500
Let me see.

422
00:31:19,780 --> 00:31:21,160
Have you lost weight?

423
00:31:21,180 --> 00:31:22,560
Have you been eating, dear?

424
00:31:22,580 --> 00:31:26,100
I've been eating a lot.

425
00:31:26,220 --> 00:31:28,100
A lot, huh?

426
00:31:28,120 --> 00:31:29,500
And who did you eat with?

427
00:31:30,500 --> 00:31:31,940
Did you eat with Soul?

428
00:31:33,460 --> 00:31:34,340
Well...

429
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:36,860
we ate together sometimes.

430
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:40,820
You know, Auntie Tai and I
have both been worried about

431
00:31:40,840 --> 00:31:43,060
whether you've been eating properly.

432
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:46,700
Here, let me take your bag.

433
00:31:46,720 --> 00:31:48,620
- Mom, go sit down first.
- Alright.

434
00:31:49,980 --> 00:31:50,580
Oh?

435
00:31:51,060 --> 00:31:52,320
What is this?

436
00:31:52,340 --> 00:31:54,140
Why is there a blanket here, dear?

437
00:31:55,060 --> 00:31:55,820
Uh...

438
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:57,100
I...

439
00:32:00,700 --> 00:32:02,780
brought it down to watch TV.

440
00:32:04,300 --> 00:32:05,900
Oh, I see.

441
00:32:06,500 --> 00:32:08,420
Let me give you a massage, Mom. Sit down.

442
00:32:09,340 --> 00:32:11,820
Oh, how do you know me so well?

443
00:32:11,840 --> 00:32:14,220
My neck and shoulders
are aching right now, dear.

444
00:32:14,280 --> 00:32:15,380
You know what?

445
00:32:15,580 --> 00:32:17,920
I had such a great time
at the meditation retreat,

446
00:32:17,940 --> 00:32:20,040
but I came back with a stiff neck.

447
00:32:20,060 --> 00:32:21,860
Because sometimes, when I was meditating,

448
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:23,760
my head would tilt down like this.

449
00:32:23,780 --> 00:32:25,560
- Ugh.
- You fell asleep, didn't you?

450
00:32:25,580 --> 00:32:27,280
I didn't.

451
00:32:27,820 --> 00:32:29,240
I just got too comfortable.

452
00:32:29,260 --> 00:32:31,020
Then how can your neck be this stiff?

453
00:32:31,500 --> 00:32:32,820
Here's some water, Mom.

454
00:32:33,260 --> 00:32:34,380
Thanks.

455
00:32:39,580 --> 00:32:40,960
While you were away,

456
00:32:40,980 --> 00:32:43,840
I didn't miss a single meal,

457
00:32:43,860 --> 00:32:45,620
and I didn't stay up late either.

458
00:32:46,540 --> 00:32:47,940
That's hard to believe.

459
00:32:48,570 --> 00:32:51,260
If you don't believe me, ask Xinxin.

460
00:32:52,100 --> 00:32:53,740
Am I hearing things?

461
00:32:54,540 --> 00:32:56,000
Well, while you were away,

462
00:32:56,020 --> 00:32:58,100
I had every meal with her.

463
00:32:58,680 --> 00:33:00,260
That means...

464
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:02,460
You and Xinxin...

465
00:33:02,500 --> 00:33:04,520
We're taking things at
just the right pace, Mom.

466
00:33:04,540 --> 00:33:07,580
Not too fast, not too slow.

467
00:33:08,300 --> 00:33:10,260
We're still getting to know each other.

468
00:33:10,980 --> 00:33:12,540
Don't tease me like that.

469
00:33:12,940 --> 00:33:15,940
You know I like her, don't you?

470
00:33:18,940 --> 00:33:20,260
Well, I...

471
00:33:21,100 --> 00:33:22,260
like her, too.

472
00:33:26,300 --> 00:33:27,420
What did you just say?

473
00:33:29,060 --> 00:33:30,500
I think

474
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:32,500
I might like her

475
00:33:32,700 --> 00:33:34,460
even more than you do now, Mom.

476
00:33:49,780 --> 00:33:50,940
Really?

477
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:53,480
She really said that.

478
00:33:56,580 --> 00:33:57,380
Uh...

479
00:33:58,090 --> 00:34:00,270
Phing...are you okay?

480
00:34:02,860 --> 00:34:04,380
I'm okay.

481
00:34:04,940 --> 00:34:06,820
I'm fine with that.

482
00:34:07,340 --> 00:34:10,700
Whoever my girl loves, I love too.

483
00:34:10,720 --> 00:34:13,700
And if the person she loves
is a good person,

484
00:34:14,820 --> 00:34:16,920
I have no problem with it at all.

485
00:34:16,940 --> 00:34:18,540
You don't have to worry.

486
00:34:20,380 --> 00:34:21,740
Thank you.

487
00:34:22,140 --> 00:34:23,060
Well...

488
00:34:23,340 --> 00:34:25,260
Soul has been so happy

489
00:34:26,140 --> 00:34:28,300
ever since Xinxin came along

490
00:34:29,100 --> 00:34:29,860
that...

491
00:34:30,220 --> 00:34:31,500
I'm afraid

492
00:34:31,780 --> 00:34:33,780
she might lose that happiness.

493
00:34:35,660 --> 00:34:37,080
I totally understand.

494
00:34:37,100 --> 00:34:40,020
We both want our children to be happy.

495
00:34:41,300 --> 00:34:42,540
So...

496
00:34:42,780 --> 00:34:45,080
let's wish them the best

497
00:34:45,100 --> 00:34:47,420
and cheer them on, okay?

498
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,620
Of course, Phing.

499
00:34:49,860 --> 00:34:51,140
Thank you.

500
00:34:51,580 --> 00:34:53,460
Of course, Tai.

501
00:34:56,420 --> 00:35:00,060
Let's see if this is
as good as my cooking.

502
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:26,900
Mom,

503
00:35:26,920 --> 00:35:28,560
do you need something?

504
00:35:29,250 --> 00:35:30,800
It's nothing.

505
00:35:31,110 --> 00:35:32,690
I just missed you.

506
00:35:32,710 --> 00:35:35,560
I haven't seen you in days,
so I wanted to talk.

507
00:35:35,770 --> 00:35:37,570
- Are you blow-drying your hair, dear?
- Yeah.

508
00:35:48,150 --> 00:35:49,670
All done.

509
00:35:50,590 --> 00:35:52,310
- Alright.
- Thank you.

510
00:35:58,330 --> 00:36:01,190
Mom, keep blow-drying my hair
for a long, long time, okay?

511
00:36:02,870 --> 00:36:06,120
You expect me
to take care of you forever, huh?

512
00:36:06,310 --> 00:36:07,510
Of course.

513
00:36:07,610 --> 00:36:09,800
You're the only one I have, Mom.

514
00:36:14,070 --> 00:36:15,490
What about Soul, dear?

515
00:36:21,590 --> 00:36:24,630
How do you feel about her?

516
00:36:26,950 --> 00:36:28,710
Well, pretty good.

517
00:36:30,050 --> 00:36:31,120
And...

518
00:36:31,350 --> 00:36:33,470
I think I like her now, too.

519
00:36:35,970 --> 00:36:38,510
Would you be okay if I liked a girl, Mom?

520
00:36:41,030 --> 00:36:43,030
Do you remember

521
00:36:43,750 --> 00:36:45,070
what I told you

522
00:36:45,750 --> 00:36:47,630
when you were little?

523
00:36:48,550 --> 00:36:49,190
Hm?

524
00:36:50,070 --> 00:36:51,950
You told me that...

525
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:54,930
you'd give me anything

526
00:36:55,610 --> 00:36:57,520
that makes me happy.

527
00:36:59,590 --> 00:37:01,310
So, are you happy, dear?

528
00:37:04,730 --> 00:37:05,510
Yes.

529
00:37:05,790 --> 00:37:07,070
I'm happy.

530
00:37:10,630 --> 00:37:12,390
Have you told her yet?

531
00:37:14,830 --> 00:37:15,990
Not yet.

532
00:37:16,470 --> 00:37:18,590
I'll tell her myself

533
00:37:18,850 --> 00:37:20,670
once I'm more sure of how I feel.

534
00:37:21,830 --> 00:37:23,430
She said she'd wait.

535
00:37:24,150 --> 00:37:25,890
So I'll just let her wait for now.

536
00:37:27,450 --> 00:37:30,150
Then don't keep her waiting
too long, dear.

537
00:37:30,850 --> 00:37:32,750
If you don't feel the same way,

538
00:37:33,270 --> 00:37:34,910
just tell her honestly.

539
00:37:37,390 --> 00:37:38,990
It won't take long, Mom.

540
00:37:42,910 --> 00:37:45,410
Let me hug you. I missed you.

541
00:37:45,430 --> 00:37:47,230
I missed you, too.

542
00:37:47,670 --> 00:37:49,570
I've made merit for you, dear.

543
00:37:49,590 --> 00:37:51,270
Thank you.

544
00:38:08,670 --> 00:38:09,630
Xinxin!

545
00:38:09,870 --> 00:38:10,530
- Oh?
- Oh?

546
00:38:10,550 --> 00:38:12,530
- Soul.
- You're here too, Lada?

547
00:38:12,550 --> 00:38:14,210
My dad sent me here.

548
00:38:14,230 --> 00:38:15,610
I didn't know you'd be here,

549
00:38:15,630 --> 00:38:16,850
so I brought Mim along.

550
00:38:16,870 --> 00:38:18,570
- If I'd known you were coming,
- Hello.

551
00:38:18,590 --> 00:38:20,310
I wouldn't have bothered Mim.

552
00:38:20,950 --> 00:38:23,400
Well, I didn't know
you were coming either.

553
00:38:24,270 --> 00:38:25,870
If you'd known I was coming,

554
00:38:26,070 --> 00:38:27,950
would you have stayed with me instead?

555
00:38:28,830 --> 00:38:29,750
Nope.

556
00:38:29,990 --> 00:38:31,990
I'd be with her either way.

557
00:38:34,950 --> 00:38:36,720
You look pretty today, Soul.

558
00:38:36,930 --> 00:38:39,230
Gosh, just one day, okay?

559
00:38:39,510 --> 00:38:40,790
I'm not used to this.

560
00:38:40,930 --> 00:38:42,120
I can't even walk properly.

561
00:38:43,110 --> 00:38:44,950
Since you usually wear pants,

562
00:38:45,110 --> 00:38:47,360
you're feeling shy in a skirt today, huh?

563
00:38:48,170 --> 00:38:48,870
You look beautiful.

564
00:38:48,890 --> 00:38:49,990
Oh?!

565
00:38:50,010 --> 00:38:51,930
Hello, girls.

566
00:38:51,950 --> 00:38:53,110
- Hello.
- Hello.

567
00:38:53,130 --> 00:38:55,150
Oh, you all look so pretty.

568
00:38:55,590 --> 00:38:58,410
Thank you as well
for inviting us today, Madam.

569
00:38:58,430 --> 00:39:00,400
Oh, of course I'd invite you.

570
00:39:00,550 --> 00:39:02,330
Well, my dad happens to be abroad,

571
00:39:02,350 --> 00:39:04,750
so he sends his apologies
for not being able to make it himself.

572
00:39:04,950 --> 00:39:06,170
No worries.

573
00:39:06,190 --> 00:39:07,510
If I had a daughter as pretty as you,

574
00:39:07,530 --> 00:39:10,370
I'd want to show her off at events, too.

575
00:39:11,990 --> 00:39:14,150
Please make yourselves at home, everyone.

576
00:39:14,170 --> 00:39:16,550
It's just a small, casual gathering.

577
00:39:18,130 --> 00:39:19,250
- Alright.
- If you'll excuse me.

578
00:39:19,270 --> 00:39:20,350
- Of course.
- Alright.

579
00:39:22,250 --> 00:39:22,950
Hey,

580
00:39:23,350 --> 00:39:24,870
wanna go grab something to eat?

581
00:39:25,310 --> 00:39:26,360
You're hungry already?

582
00:39:28,190 --> 00:39:29,970
She's a little hard to take care of, Soul.

583
00:39:29,990 --> 00:39:30,960
She's a big eater, you know.

584
00:39:31,750 --> 00:39:33,080
I can handle her.

585
00:39:34,990 --> 00:39:36,070
I'm speechless.

586
00:39:37,970 --> 00:39:38,670
Come on.

587
00:39:48,290 --> 00:39:49,130
- Hey.
- Hm?

588
00:39:49,150 --> 00:39:50,230
I'm not used to this.

589
00:39:50,870 --> 00:39:51,990
You'll get used to it.

590
00:39:52,590 --> 00:39:54,730
Nope, this one's a veggie.

591
00:39:54,750 --> 00:39:56,170
Oh, but I'll take the cake

592
00:39:56,190 --> 00:39:57,150
and...

593
00:39:57,870 --> 00:40:00,150
Oh, or should I eat something first?

594
00:40:13,310 --> 00:40:14,120
Xinxin.

595
00:40:14,270 --> 00:40:14,910
Hm?

596
00:40:16,630 --> 00:40:17,470
Let's head back.

597
00:40:19,790 --> 00:40:21,990
Why? Aren't you having fun?

598
00:40:24,290 --> 00:40:26,370
I just don't want you to feel down.

599
00:40:27,790 --> 00:40:28,630
About what?

600
00:40:32,530 --> 00:40:34,470
Your half-sister, Linlin.

601
00:40:34,790 --> 00:40:36,230
She's here too, you know.

602
00:40:42,310 --> 00:40:43,950
I've known she was here for a while.

603
00:40:46,110 --> 00:40:47,630
And you didn't feel anything at all?

604
00:40:49,770 --> 00:40:50,950
Of course, I did.

605
00:40:52,070 --> 00:40:53,550
I still feel the same.

606
00:40:55,550 --> 00:40:56,470
But...

607
00:40:57,320 --> 00:40:59,900
I don't see why I should avoid her.

608
00:41:00,590 --> 00:41:01,710
If I did,

609
00:41:02,490 --> 00:41:04,130
I'd have to avoid her my whole life.

610
00:41:07,100 --> 00:41:07,960
Besides,

611
00:41:08,310 --> 00:41:10,430
Madam Waen invited me,

612
00:41:10,830 --> 00:41:12,910
so I'm a guest here, too.

613
00:41:13,490 --> 00:41:14,930
We can just mind our own business.

614
00:41:19,550 --> 00:41:21,750
And now I'm not alone anymore.

615
00:41:24,770 --> 00:41:26,310
I have you, Soul.

616
00:41:31,450 --> 00:41:32,870
You're doing great.

617
00:41:36,350 --> 00:41:37,510
So...

618
00:41:37,830 --> 00:41:38,990
I'll go to the restroom first.

619
00:41:39,650 --> 00:41:41,150
Alright. I'll come with you.

620
00:41:41,400 --> 00:41:42,280
It's alright.

621
00:41:42,630 --> 00:41:45,110
If we both disappear
at the same time, it'll look bad.

622
00:41:45,830 --> 00:41:47,630
It's okay. I can go by myself.

623
00:42:00,010 --> 00:42:00,910
Alright.

624
00:42:13,510 --> 00:42:15,090
When are you gonna stop running away?

625
00:42:17,190 --> 00:42:18,370
I'm not running away.

626
00:42:19,390 --> 00:42:20,830
I just don't want to talk.

627
00:42:21,710 --> 00:42:23,350
Don't flatter yourself.

628
00:42:25,150 --> 00:42:27,150
Have you talked to Dad at all?

629
00:42:29,150 --> 00:42:30,470
I don't have a dad.

630
00:42:33,990 --> 00:42:34,950
Xinxin,

631
00:42:36,260 --> 00:42:38,860
can you stop acting like a spoiled child?

632
00:42:39,970 --> 00:42:42,710
Do you expect everyone
to follow you around all the time, huh?

633
00:42:44,870 --> 00:42:46,270
Who's following me?

634
00:42:47,550 --> 00:42:48,870
I don't remember anyone doing that.

635
00:42:49,830 --> 00:42:51,550
All I can remember is...

636
00:42:52,410 --> 00:42:54,350
waiting for someone
to come find me that day,

637
00:42:54,910 --> 00:42:56,030
but no one did.

638
00:42:57,150 --> 00:42:58,230
Neither you

639
00:42:59,500 --> 00:43:00,620
nor Dad.

640
00:43:03,500 --> 00:43:05,300
Is that all you can remember?

641
00:43:07,930 --> 00:43:09,430
Some things

642
00:43:10,330 --> 00:43:12,730
just aren't that easy, Xinxin.

643
00:43:14,950 --> 00:43:16,950
One day, you'll understand everything.

644
00:43:19,310 --> 00:43:21,230
I'm just an outsider anyway.

645
00:43:26,570 --> 00:43:28,670
You've never been an outsider to me.

646
00:43:32,750 --> 00:43:34,830
But I've never been a part of it either.

647
00:44:00,920 --> 00:44:03,480
[Happy Birthday]

648
00:44:05,000 --> 00:44:07,000
Dad will be here soon.

649
00:44:11,440 --> 00:44:12,920
Where is he?

650
00:44:14,960 --> 00:44:16,560
Maybe he's stuck in traffic, dear.

651
00:44:16,700 --> 00:44:18,120
He should be here soon.

652
00:45:04,840 --> 00:45:06,200
Oh, Xinxin?

653
00:45:07,320 --> 00:45:08,600
What are you doing here?

654
00:45:10,100 --> 00:45:11,520
Did you have a fight with Soul?

655
00:45:12,040 --> 00:45:13,720
No, of course not. We didn't fight.

656
00:45:14,480 --> 00:45:15,760
I just want some peace and quiet.

657
00:45:17,080 --> 00:45:18,540
Me, too.

658
00:45:18,560 --> 00:45:20,440
All these people are making me dizzy.

659
00:45:24,080 --> 00:45:25,280
What about Ms. Mim?

660
00:45:26,380 --> 00:45:27,640
She's still inside.

661
00:45:27,960 --> 00:45:29,480
Just let her party all she wants.

662
00:45:29,720 --> 00:45:31,600
She gets along with people easily.

663
00:45:31,750 --> 00:45:32,960
You know,

664
00:45:33,160 --> 00:45:35,360
she's made lots of friends her mom's age.

665
00:45:38,960 --> 00:45:40,000
You look...

666
00:45:40,700 --> 00:45:42,920
happy when you're talking about Ms. Mim.

667
00:45:43,960 --> 00:45:45,320
Your eyes light up.

668
00:45:46,480 --> 00:45:47,560
I'm happy.

669
00:45:49,360 --> 00:45:52,680
I guess I'm the type
who loves hard and hates hard.

670
00:45:53,560 --> 00:45:54,920
When I love,

671
00:45:55,020 --> 00:45:56,680
I go all in.

672
00:45:57,000 --> 00:45:58,480
But if I don't,

673
00:45:59,080 --> 00:46:00,480
I won't regret a thing,

674
00:46:01,860 --> 00:46:03,420
because I've already given it my all.

675
00:46:06,980 --> 00:46:08,640
That sounds pretty tiring.

676
00:46:10,600 --> 00:46:11,880
Loving someone that much

677
00:46:13,040 --> 00:46:14,960
sounds like giving it your all.

678
00:46:17,900 --> 00:46:19,600
It's tiring, but it's worth it.

679
00:46:21,120 --> 00:46:23,880
There's no need to play
guessing games, Xinxin.

680
00:46:26,000 --> 00:46:27,440
So, how are things

681
00:46:27,760 --> 00:46:28,800
between you and Soul?

682
00:46:32,000 --> 00:46:33,160
Still the same.

683
00:46:33,340 --> 00:46:34,080
Hm?

684
00:46:34,720 --> 00:46:37,160
I thought you'd already
agreed to be her girlfriend.

685
00:46:37,480 --> 00:46:38,600
Not yet.

686
00:46:40,480 --> 00:46:42,720
What are you afraid of?

687
00:46:43,300 --> 00:46:44,040
Hm?

688
00:46:45,680 --> 00:46:47,360
I'm afraid that...

689
00:46:48,840 --> 00:46:50,440
one day, when she's no longer here,

690
00:46:52,360 --> 00:46:54,360
I won't know how to live without her.

691
00:46:59,300 --> 00:47:00,520
Is she with you right now?

692
00:47:03,000 --> 00:47:04,000
She is.

693
00:47:04,820 --> 00:47:06,200
Then what are you waiting for?

694
00:47:07,260 --> 00:47:09,100
Are you gonna wait until she's gone?

695
00:47:11,240 --> 00:47:14,360
If she's gone and you're left
bawling your eyes out,

696
00:47:14,740 --> 00:47:16,300
don't expect Nan and me

697
00:47:16,320 --> 00:47:18,000
to feel sorry for you. I'm warning you.

698
00:47:21,240 --> 00:47:22,120
Xinxin.

699
00:47:23,120 --> 00:47:24,720
If you like her, just say it.

700
00:47:25,560 --> 00:47:27,640
There's no need
to make things complicated.

701
00:47:29,600 --> 00:47:31,960
Got it, you little menace?

702
00:47:32,960 --> 00:47:33,720
Mm.

703
00:47:34,100 --> 00:47:34,900
I gotta go.

704
00:47:56,740 --> 00:47:58,400
Oh, Soul?

705
00:47:58,760 --> 00:47:59,760
Where are you going?

706
00:48:00,100 --> 00:48:01,660
I'm looking for Xinxin.

707
00:48:01,680 --> 00:48:02,980
She said she was going to the restroom,

708
00:48:03,000 --> 00:48:04,840
but she's nowhere to be found.

709
00:48:06,080 --> 00:48:08,840
She's on the balcony,
acting like the lead in a music video.

710
00:48:10,020 --> 00:48:11,140
Soul.

711
00:48:12,540 --> 00:48:14,220
Could you please

712
00:48:14,240 --> 00:48:16,560
be kind and patient with her?

713
00:48:18,500 --> 00:48:20,160
She's never had a partner

714
00:48:20,700 --> 00:48:22,320
or been in love.

715
00:48:23,620 --> 00:48:25,000
She's good at everything,

716
00:48:26,500 --> 00:48:28,280
except when it comes to her own heart.

717
00:48:31,000 --> 00:48:33,400
She acts like
she doesn't care about anything,

718
00:48:34,800 --> 00:48:37,040
but she actually cares about everything.

719
00:48:39,200 --> 00:48:40,400
Most importantly,

720
00:48:42,720 --> 00:48:44,600
she's afraid of being abandoned.

721
00:48:49,160 --> 00:48:50,840
I won't leave her.

722
00:48:51,820 --> 00:48:53,400
Don't worry, Lada.

723
00:49:11,700 --> 00:49:13,820
What are you doing
standing here all alone?

724
00:49:16,520 --> 00:49:17,640
Aren't you cold?

725
00:49:23,800 --> 00:49:25,160
Soul...

726
00:49:29,100 --> 00:49:30,420
Go ahead.

727
00:49:30,900 --> 00:49:32,240
I'm listening.

728
00:49:38,640 --> 00:49:40,880
When you said you liked me...

729
00:49:44,500 --> 00:49:46,340
I really like you.

730
00:49:47,620 --> 00:49:50,100
But if you're not sure or don't want to...

731
00:49:50,120 --> 00:49:51,480
I like you, too.

732
00:50:03,440 --> 00:50:04,880
Could you say that again?

733
00:50:07,760 --> 00:50:09,880
I like you, Soul.

734
00:50:11,940 --> 00:50:12,880
Hey, hey.

735
00:50:12,900 --> 00:50:14,000
What are you doing?

736
00:50:14,120 --> 00:50:15,220
We can't!

737
00:50:15,240 --> 00:50:16,400
Why?

738
00:50:16,500 --> 00:50:18,240
Haven't we already kissed?

739
00:50:19,240 --> 00:50:20,920
But that was indoors.

740
00:50:20,940 --> 00:50:22,360
We're outside now.

741
00:50:25,220 --> 00:50:27,240
So that means we can kiss

742
00:50:27,690 --> 00:50:29,280
if we're inside, right?

743
00:50:31,160 --> 00:50:32,760
- What are you even saying?!
- Ow!

744
00:50:35,200 --> 00:50:36,320
So...

745
00:50:38,000 --> 00:50:39,960
how will things be between us from now on?

746
00:50:41,360 --> 00:50:42,080
I mean...

747
00:50:42,700 --> 00:50:44,760
what am I getting myself into?

748
00:50:45,760 --> 00:50:48,680
I don't know how I'm supposed to act.

749
00:50:57,320 --> 00:50:58,920
Things will be

750
00:50:59,090 --> 00:51:01,050
a lot clearer between us.

751
00:51:02,090 --> 00:51:03,810
But if calling each other "girlfriends"

752
00:51:04,190 --> 00:51:06,330
feels like too much right now,

753
00:51:06,920 --> 00:51:08,620
we can just take things slow

754
00:51:08,640 --> 00:51:10,120
and get to know each other.

755
00:51:11,720 --> 00:51:13,640
When you're ready,

756
00:51:14,180 --> 00:51:16,320
we can make it official.

757
00:51:19,600 --> 00:51:22,800
How long do we have to keep talking
before we make it official?

758
00:51:23,000 --> 00:51:24,340
Wow, Xinxin.

759
00:51:24,360 --> 00:51:26,480
I think that should be my question.

760
00:51:26,660 --> 00:51:28,480
How about ten years?

761
00:51:28,700 --> 00:51:30,130
Ten years again?

762
00:51:30,300 --> 00:51:32,160
What is it with you
and the number ten, huh?

763
00:51:32,260 --> 00:51:33,320
Or twenty?

764
00:51:34,780 --> 00:51:36,100
Whatever you want.

765
00:51:36,120 --> 00:51:38,040
Ten years, twenty years,
I don't mind at all.

766
00:51:38,900 --> 00:51:40,720
But if we're doing this,
we have to end up dating.

767
00:51:41,590 --> 00:51:43,150
Otherwise, let's just skip the talking

768
00:51:43,560 --> 00:51:45,440
and start dating today.

769
00:51:46,320 --> 00:51:48,200
Easy there, Ms. Lioness.

770
00:51:52,320 --> 00:51:54,800
And I have one more thing to tell you.

771
00:51:58,160 --> 00:51:59,640
Once you agree,

772
00:52:00,190 --> 00:52:01,760
there's no turning back.

773
00:52:03,580 --> 00:52:06,920
Starting today,

774
00:52:07,200 --> 00:52:09,540
we're officially in the talking stage.

775
00:52:13,680 --> 00:52:15,920
Who said you could hug me, huh?

776
00:52:16,140 --> 00:52:17,960
You didn't say I couldn't.

777
00:52:19,960 --> 00:52:21,480
Too tight.

778
00:52:21,500 --> 00:52:24,420
- Come on.
- You're not stopping me either.

779
00:52:39,860 --> 00:52:41,000
Keep going.

780
00:52:41,860 --> 00:52:42,640
Oh.

781
00:52:42,820 --> 00:52:44,281
You don't have to call me "Ms." anymore.

782
00:52:44,293 --> 00:52:45,800
Just call me "Xinxin."

783
00:52:45,900 --> 00:52:47,840
Alright, you said it yourself, Xinxin.

784
00:52:47,860 --> 00:52:48,840
Yeah, Mim.

785
00:52:50,160 --> 00:52:51,520
- Come on, cheers!
- Official yet?

786
00:52:52,040 --> 00:52:53,520
- Huh?
- Are you two official yet?

787
00:52:53,960 --> 00:52:55,160
We're in the talking stage.

788
00:52:55,380 --> 00:52:56,120
What?!

789
00:52:56,340 --> 00:52:58,080
How many steps
until you're actually dating?

790
00:53:01,740 --> 00:53:04,120
Are they moving too slow,
or are we too fast?

791
00:53:05,500 --> 00:53:06,800
They're too slow, obviously.

792
00:53:06,960 --> 00:53:07,860
- Am I right?
- Mm.

793
00:53:10,360 --> 00:53:12,000
Bottoms up, Xinxin!

794
00:53:20,560 --> 00:53:21,840
Soul.

795
00:53:21,900 --> 00:53:23,280
Come dance with us.

796
00:53:23,300 --> 00:53:24,120
Hey.

797
00:53:24,140 --> 00:53:24,960
Come on.

798
00:53:46,320 --> 00:53:48,680
Soul, are you taking me to a hotel?

799
00:53:49,040 --> 00:53:51,000
But we're already at the hotel.

800
00:53:52,390 --> 00:53:53,910
We're staying here tonight.

801
00:53:54,500 --> 00:53:57,600
If I take you home in this state tonight,

802
00:53:57,980 --> 00:54:01,120
Auntie Phing will chew me out for sure.

803
00:54:03,300 --> 00:54:04,780
For sure.

804
00:54:05,520 --> 00:54:06,320
But...

805
00:54:06,840 --> 00:54:08,680
I don't have a change of clothes.

806
00:54:10,520 --> 00:54:11,800
Well...

807
00:54:13,460 --> 00:54:15,850
Can you wear a bathrobe for now?

808
00:54:16,610 --> 00:54:17,650
Alright.

809
00:54:22,860 --> 00:54:24,440
How drunk are you, huh?

810
00:54:27,840 --> 00:54:30,000
I'm just a little tipsy, but...

811
00:54:30,620 --> 00:54:32,200
I'm still clear-headed.

812
00:54:36,160 --> 00:54:37,700
Come on, turn around.

813
00:54:37,720 --> 00:54:40,200
Let me help you change.

814
00:55:19,720 --> 00:55:21,000
Soul.

815
00:55:22,520 --> 00:55:24,520
You're not going to leave me, are you?

816
00:55:28,420 --> 00:55:29,840
I'll be with you

817
00:55:30,880 --> 00:55:33,160
until you don't need me anymore.

818
00:55:54,400 --> 00:55:56,000
If you don't stop me,

819
00:55:58,600 --> 00:56:00,080
I won't stop.

820
00:56:03,160 --> 00:56:04,480
Not stopping you

821
00:56:05,900 --> 00:56:07,960
means I'm saying yes, doesn't it?

822
00:56:42,220 --> 00:56:45,080
Xinxin seems really happy these days.

823
00:56:45,100 --> 00:56:46,420
Or maybe...

824
00:56:46,440 --> 00:56:47,700
they're secretly dating

825
00:56:47,720 --> 00:56:50,000
and just haven't told us.

826
00:56:50,280 --> 00:56:52,240
You're sneaky, Ms. Lioness.

827
00:56:52,520 --> 00:56:54,100
Where are you taking me today?

828
00:56:54,120 --> 00:56:55,220
You'll see.

829
00:56:55,240 --> 00:56:57,300
Definitely not just grabbing a meal.

830
00:56:57,320 --> 00:56:59,840
Or are you going to ask her
to be your girlfriend today?

831
00:57:00,700 --> 00:57:01,600
I missed you.

832
00:57:13,270 --> 00:57:14,520
Hello, Xinxin.

833
00:57:15,040 --> 00:57:16,320
Where are you?

834
00:57:16,840 --> 00:57:18,320
I'm already at the entrance.

835
00:57:19,460 --> 00:57:20,640
Where?

836
00:57:21,560 --> 00:57:23,120
I'm right in front of the backdrop.

837
00:57:26,880 --> 00:57:27,880
Soul.

838
00:57:41,760 --> 00:57:42,960
Found me yet?

839
00:57:45,680 --> 00:57:46,840
Found you.

840
00:57:48,580 --> 00:57:49,900
Surprised, huh?

841
00:57:49,920 --> 00:57:51,720
Never seen me dressed up like this.

842
00:57:55,240 --> 00:57:56,640
So pretty.

843
00:57:59,620 --> 00:58:00,840
Thank you.
